{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42401","headline":"又题白鹭洲江鸥送陈君 · 徐铉","name":"又题白鹭洲江鸥送陈君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鹭洲边江路斜，轻鸥按翼满平沙。\n吾徒来送远行客，停舟爲尔长叹息。\n酒旗鱼艇两无猜，月影芦花镇相得。\n离筵一曲怨复清，满座销魂鸟不惊。\n人生不及水禽乐，安用虚名上麟阁。\n同心携手今如此，金鼎丹砂何寂寞。\n天涯後会眇难期，从此又应添白髭。\n愿君不忘分飞处，长保翩翩洁白姿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}